Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:33.00,BrandSub,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1020,88)}Manim × 积木
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1450)}Manim 很强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:04.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Manim 是数学动画的天花板
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:07.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1450)}但我不会 {\c&H00D7FF&}Python{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:10.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,所以，我把它做成了积木
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:13.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,拖一个场景
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:16.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,拖一个文字，再拖一个动画
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,右边，就是真正的 Manim 代码
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:20.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,点一下渲染
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:22.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,动画真的跑起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:24.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,每一块都能改
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:26.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,每一行代码都能看懂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:30.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,不会 Python，也能让数学动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:33.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,这是 Visual Python